215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Creative urban spaces and regeneration, enhance cultural vibrancy, attract tourism, and promote community engagement. When planned accordingly, they can support the expansion of tourism development to new urban areas promoting a better dispersal of tourism demand, while also paving the way for the creation of socially and environmentally conscious urban spaces that prioritize a better quality of life for residents and the environment. These spaces provide shared opportunities for both residents and visitors, enriching cultural life and providing platforms for cultural exchange and mutual understanding. By establishing creative urban spaces and initiating regeneration projects, cities can nurture dynamic environments that celebrate local heritage and creativity. This approach not only dynamizes urban areas, but also stimulates economic development by attracting tourists and fostering creativity, thereby making cities more inclusive, vibrant and liveable. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10 11]
>>
