291 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Cebu City Heritage District Council, established in early 2023, is responsible for the sustainable preservation, development, and management of the heritage district. The initiative focuses on preserving cultural heritage through eco-friendly practices, promoting Cebu's history to tourists, and involving local residents in conservation efforts. It aims to foster pride in cultural identity, encourage sustainable practices, promote economic development through heritage tourism, and enhance educational opportunities on Cebu's history, traditions, and architecture for students, scholars, and the public.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
292 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Dubrovnik, Croatia: The Lazareti)
/E (Dubrovnik, Croatia: The Lazareti)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
293 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Creative Hub of Dubrovnik initiative revitalized the historical Lazareti complex, a former quarantine station near Dubrovnik's walls, transforming it into a vibrant cultural and tourism hub. Recognized as a cultural asset of Croatia, the project involved extensive renovations, equipping the complex with modern facilities, and creating diverse programs to ensure both institutional and financial sustainability. Led by the City of Dubrovnik in collaboration with ten public, private, and civil sector partners, the initiative established year-round cultural, scientific, educational, and tourism programs. The project emphasizes the touristic valorization of cultural heritage and aims to position Dubrovnik as a cultural and tourist destination beyond its seasonal appeal while preserving its rich heritage.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
