316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The plan emphasizes initiatives that focus on sustainable tourism rooted in the city's traditions and culture. It also addresses challenges such as traffic congestion and deteriorating hygiene caused by an under managed tourism growth. The plan outlines strategies to preserve and promote local culture and tradition, while ensuring the well-being of the local community. Action plans include promoting local crafts and food products, collaborating with local travel agencies to develop new travel packages, and developing international sales channels for crafts, among other initiatives. The city also holds regular meetings with the municipal government, travel agencies, private businesses, and local residents to discuss initiatives to build a sustainable city, through tourism.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
