327 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The 1000-hour course is designed to train up to 25 young professionals under the age of 29 per edition as expert technicians in the valorization of products in the dairy supply chain.  Students gain in-depth knowledge of production processes and acquire skills to add value to businesses by ensuring that product preparation meets quality, safety, and authenticity standards. They also look at branding, sharing information history and characteristics of the products, and developing promotional strategies in line with local cultural tourism. This programme provides local dairy businesses with a professionally trained workforce, strengthening the local food industry, maintaining the quality of the city's gastronomy, and boosting the city's attractiveness to tourists.)
