/E (Dubai has become as a global leader in the digitization of its cultural and creative sectors, setting a benchmark for innovation and accessibility. The city has fully digitized its museum experience, providing open access to immersive virtual tours of its museums and heritage sites. In addition, in response to the challenges posed by COVID-19, Dubai launched a wide range of online initiatives that focus on building a sustainable digital ecosystem for its cultural and creative sectors, including virtual museum tours and e-learning courses. These platforms not only ensured continued cultural engagement, but also extended the city's reach, attracting new talent, audiences, and collaborations from around the world.)
